WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.079
Continue the saved service-estimate guide from Lesson Four Point Two.

00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:08.634
Keep its person, result, outline and boundary.

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:14.220
Give AI the role of instructional editor, using only approved inputs.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:20.822
Supply three hours at forty dollars per hour and a separate twenty-dollar cost.

00:00:20.822 --> 00:00:27.932
Label these as invented training figures; taxes, discounts and other costs are not supplied.

00:00:27.932 --> 00:00:37.074
Specify a calm professional voice: plain words, one step at a time, visible calculations and no inflated promises.

00:00:37.074 --> 00:00:44.692
The approved request asks for a source-bounded sample, verification flags and reflective questions preserving choice.

00:00:44.692 --> 00:00:47.739
Keep the original response for review.

00:00:47.739 --> 00:00:54.849
A generated passage is a draft, not a verified claim or approved customer quote.

00:00:54.849 --> 00:01:00.943
Do not let the model invent source facts, prices or personal expertise.
